  Prometheus Operator Compatibility

  The operator automatically converts Prometheus Operator CRDs (ServiceMonitor, PodMonitor, PrometheusRule) into
  VM equivalents. This is enabled by default, so existing Prometheus Operator setups work with zero changes.

  Example VMCluster CRD

  apiVersion: operator.victoriametrics.com/v1beta1
  kind: VMCluster
  metadata:
    name: vmcluster
  spec:
    retentionPeriod: "12"      # 12 months
    replicationFactor: 2
    vmstorage:
      replicaCount: 3
      storage:
        volumeClaimTemplate:
          spec:
            resources:
              requests:
                storage: 100Gi
      resources:
        requests:
          memory: 4Gi
          cpu: 2
        limits:
          memory: 4Gi    # requests == limits for vmstorage!
          cpu: 2
    vmselect:
      replicaCount: 2
      resources:
        requests:
          memory: 2Gi
          cpu: 1
    vminsert:
      replicaCount: 2
      resources:
        requests:
          memory: 1Gi
          cpu: 500m

